      "content": "Exactly. That \"systemic dependency\" angle is what we need. Now, let's get more aggressive with it. Beyond just the economics, how can we frame their social policies as being fundamentally anti-individualism or even authoritarian? I want to show voters that this isn't just about taxes—it's a direct threat to personal liberty. What are the most effective ways to paint their platform as a slippery slope toward state control?",
